@startuml SEQ_05_MENGAKSES_MODUL
!theme plain
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam TitleFontSize 14
title Sequence Diagram — SEQ-05: Mengakses Modul Praktikum

actor       "Praktikan"              as Praktikan
boundary    "Browser"                as Browser
control     "ModulPraktikumController" as Controller
entity      "ModulPraktikum Model"   as Model

== Lihat Daftar Modul (Praktikan Login) ==

Praktikan ->  Browser    : Buka menu "Modul Saya"
Browser --> Praktikan : response / redirect
Browser   ->  Controller : GET /praktikan/modul
Controller --> Browser : response / redirect
Controller -> Model      : Query modul yang berhak diakses praktikan
Model --> Controller     : Data modul
Controller --> Browser   : Render halaman daftar modul
Browser    --> Praktikan : Tampil daftar modul: nama praktikum, pertemuan, tombol preview/download

== Buka / Preview Modul ==

Praktikan ->  Browser    : Klik tombol "Buka" pada modul
Browser --> Praktikan : response / redirect
Browser   ->  Controller : GET /praktikum/{id}/modul/{modulId}/view
Controller --> Browser : response / redirect
Controller -> Model      : Query modul
Model --> Controller     : Data modul
Controller --> Browser   : Stream file (inline PDF viewer)
Browser    --> Praktikan : Tampil konten modul di browser

== Akses via Link Publik (Hash) — tanpa login ==

Praktikan ->  Browser    : Buka URL publik /modul/{hash}
Browser --> Praktikan : response / redirect
Browser   ->  Controller : GET /modul/{hash}
Controller --> Browser : response / redirect
Controller -> Model      : Query modul berdasarkan hash
Model --> Controller     : Data modul
Controller --> Browser   : Stream file modul
Browser    --> Praktikan : Preview modul tanpa perlu login

@enduml